Windows XInput reconnect backport for Mumble f1954599ec510a4eb894106f79631f7ff8f1b6a1.
Based on M-ax/mumble commits ed1a86f04edd5d269548181805f86998f441084e,
21c9f7b062f0bb4b6ed69d42728ab79a6fa6a2c5, and
d761e22a5f72054c75cb2c2051883cc1f14bacf7.

Adaptation: use a mutex-protected std::deque instead of upgrading the pinned
SPSC queue dependency. Ordinary input remains bounded; removal notifications
remain ordered and are not dropped on input-queue saturation. Keep the pinned
UTF-8 header and object-library test target.

